stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Available: listed in an index (Marketplace)
  Available --> Installed: an admin installs it and agrees to its scopes
  Installed --> Connected: someone connects an account (OAuth or API key)
  Connected --> Enabled: tools turned on for a bot
  Enabled --> Enabled: the bot uses tools (through the pipeline)
  Enabled --> Connected: tools turned off
  Connected --> Installed: disconnect (token revoked)
  Installed --> Available: uninstall (installation row removed)
  Enabled --> Paused: token expired or version withdrawn
  Paused --> Enabled: reconnect or upgrade
